                  &lt;/div&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.kungahuset.se/arkiv/nyheter/2026-11-04-kronprinsessan-gav-audiens-for-ungerns-talman</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate></item><item><title>
                        Prins Daniel besökte Njurfonden
                     </title><link>https://www.kungahuset.se/arkiv/nyheter/2026-11-03-prins-daniel-besokte-njurfonden</link><description>&lt;div class="kh-news-feed__item--preamble"&gt;
